Z||000008||LT1 Chop Top||05-16-2001||12:24 AM||||You are right Standard.  My 88 is not a chop top, but it has been lowered so much, along with very low profile tires, that it is only slightly higher than my Chop Top.  Chop top roof is lower than the 88, but the rear deck of the 88 is lower than the chop top.  Hopefully I will have pics of both posted soon, but I almost never have them out at the same time.||||reg||1
Z||000009||FieroGTguy||05-16-2001||01:45 AM||||I think that I'm going to have you beat this summer...  I'm chopping the top of my already lowered GT.  Don't feel bad...  Your LT-1 will blow my new 3.1 Jasper that I dropped in there.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Greg||||reg||1
