Z||000012||LT1 Chop Top||05-16-2001||05:47 PM||||The wheels are DP "Enduro" 17x9 rear, and 16x7.5 front.  Tires are Toyo Proxes 255-40-17 rear, and 225-45-16 front.  The whole set-up was over $3k.<P>GT Guy, Make sure you post pics when you get the chop done...I am sure we would all love to see how it comes out.  What color anyway??  Don't worry about the 3.1, there is always room for 2 more cylinders later! ; )||||reg||1
Z||000013||Loki||05-16-2001||05:48 PM||||So 9" wide wheels can fit out back? Any modifications?<BR><P>------------------<BR>Loki<BR>ICQ# 16477998<BR>www.cox-internet.com/fiero  !!!UPDATED!!!||||reg||1
Z||000014||LT1 Chop Top||05-16-2001||07:23 PM||||Loki,<P>I have drop spindles (AVO I think) in the rear, and 12 position AVO drop spindles in front.  Rear also has urethane suspension bushings.||||reg||1
