Z||000017||LT1 Chop Top||05-16-2001||09:48 PM||||Wolfhound,<P>The antenna has been removed, and filled in before the car was repainted (so were the pontiac letters on the head light cover).  I now have a C.A.T (Creative Antenna Technologies) which is located in the upper right interior corner of the windshield.  It does not provide great range, but it makes the car look smoother.<P>Anyone notice my front hood ornament???<P>||||reg||1
