Z||000022||LT1 Chop Top||05-17-2001||05:30 PM||||The exhaust system is by Supertrapp (at supertrapp.com).  It is an adjustable exhaust system using "disc technology" that backpressure can be increased or decreased by adding or deleting disc rings.  See <A HREF="http://www.supertrapp.com/how_it_works.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.supertrapp.com/how_it_works.htm</A> <P>The part I like is how you can change the exhaust tone to sound very throaty like a Ferrari!  No annoying buzz like those sphincter pipes on Hondas!!!.  I hate that.||||reg||8
Z||000023||Bluebottlejunky||05-17-2001||08:46 PM||||How much did you pay for all of them?  Were they are to intall?  It seems like there really made for ATVs and Bikes not much for cars...Id feel werid calling<P>------------------<BR>Mike<BR>85'GT 4sp, "Im just glad she drives!" oh..wait!<BR>AIM: Fierofanatic2001||||reg||1
Z||000024||LT1 Chop Top||05-17-2001||09:05 PM||||Seems the cost of the entire system w/ install was about $900.  I have seen this system on several Fieros, as well as Mustangs, Firebirds, Cameros, and several motorcycles.  I wouldn't hesitate to call them at all, tell them what you have seen and they will work with you.||||reg||1
Z||000025||1FST2M6||05-18-2001||01:58 PM||||AVO spindles?.. the same AVO that works with Miata Turbo kits? got a link?  <A HREF="http://www.avoturbo.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.avoturbo.com/</A>   <P><BR>nice ride...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> ||||reg||1
