Z||000028||LT1 Chop Top||05-20-2001||01:33 AM||||Thanks for the comments everyone.  I don't know a great deal about the suspension, as the majority of it was done before I had the car by one of the technical advisors of FOCOA, at Fiero Motorsports in Cali.<BR>However, a buddie of mine in my local Fiero club is using the HELD suspension from what used to be Ryan Motorsports.  It has not been completely installed yet, but he seems to like what it has done so far.  Here are some recent pics of the work he is doing. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Myfront1.jpg"> <BR>||||reg||1
